  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7211001",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721100101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721100101": {
            "id": "721100101",
            "speakerId": 20297,
            "speakerName": "Iwakura Mitsunari",
            "text": "Why did I leave the dojo to become Lord Kujou's instructor...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100102"
            ]
          },
          "721100102": {
            "id": "721100102",
            "speakerId": 20297,
            "speakerName": "Iwakura Mitsunari",
            "text": "Yanagiha and Okazaki, as well as Mifune... why did they all leave me..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7211002",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721100201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721100201": {
            "id": "721100201",
            "speakerId": 20298,
            "speakerName": "Okazaki Toraemon",
            "text": "...now, the blade of Iwakura Kouin is the only thing we're missing.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100202"
            ]
          },
          "721100202": {
            "id": "721100202",
            "speakerId": 20299,
            "speakerName": "Yanagiha Arashi",
            "text": "The ancestral \"Hakuen Michimitsu Amenoma\" of the Iwakura Clan, huh... Say, do you remember, when you and Kunihiko were first adopted, while Master Eiin wasn't looking...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100203"
            ]
          },
          "721100203": {
            "id": "721100203",
            "speakerId": 20298,
            "speakerName": "Okazaki Toraemon",
            "text": "We have already been expelled. There's no need to call him \"Master.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100204"
            ]
          },
          "721100204": {
            "id": "721100204",
            "speakerId": 20299,
            "speakerName": "Yanagiha Arashi",
            "text": "But Okazaki...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100205"
            ]
          },
          "721100205": {
            "id": "721100205",
            "speakerId": 20299,
            "speakerName": "Yanagiha Arashi",
            "text": "\"When you weigh affection against righteousness on a scale, a real swordsman must walk the path of righteousness.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100206"
            ]
          },
          "721100206": {
            "id": "721100206",
            "speakerId": 20299,
            "speakerName": "Yanagiha Arashi",
            "text": "Since Master said so, it means he was not willing to expel us, but had no other choice.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100207"
            ]
          },
          "721100207": {
            "id": "721100207",
            "speakerId": 20298,
            "speakerName": "Okazaki Toraemon",
            "text": "Of course he was unwilling. But since he has already decided to become the sword of the Shogun and carry out the Vision Hunt Decree, then we can only...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100208"
            ]
          },
          "721100208": {
            "id": "721100208",
            "speakerId": 20299,
            "speakerName": "Yanagiha Arashi",
            "text": "We can only choose our own righteous path. After all, \"a real swordsman must walk the path of righteousness.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100209"
            ]
          },
          "721100209": {
            "id": "721100209",
            "speakerId": 20299,
            "speakerName": "Yanagiha Arashi",
            "text": "And yet, Master's own righteousness was defeated in the end.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100210"
            ]
          },
          "721100210": {
            "id": "721100210",
            "speakerId": 20298,
            "speakerName": "Okazaki Toraemon",
            "text": "That's right. We must avenge them all. Kunihiko, the others — even Iwakura Kouin.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100211"
            ]
          },
          "721100211": {
            "id": "721100211",
            "speakerId": 20298,
            "speakerName": "Okazaki Toraemon",
            "text": "Such is the righteousness of expelled disciples like ourselves.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100212"
            ]
          },
          "721100212": {
            "id": "721100212",
            "speakerId": 20299,
            "speakerName": "Yanagiha Arashi",
            "text": "This must also be Master's blessing. Our first object of vengeance came to us, just like that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100213"
            ]
          },
          "721100213": {
            "id": "721100213",
            "speakerId": 20298,
            "speakerName": "Okazaki Toraemon",
            "text": "#You are right. You must be {NICKNAME}. I've heard about your story.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100214"
            ]
          },
          "721100214": {
            "id": "721100214",
            "speakerId": 20298,
            "speakerName": "Okazaki Toraemon",
            "text": "In the world of swordsmen, only blood can cleanse blood. I assume you are prepared to face the Ex-Iwakura Art Menkyo Kaiden?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7211003",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721100301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721100301": {
            "id": "721100301",
            "speakerId": 20297,
            "speakerName": "Iwakura Mitsunari",
            "text": "Why did I leave the dojo to become Lord Kujou's instructor...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100302"
            ]
          },
          "721100302": {
            "id": "721100302",
            "speakerId": 20297,
            "speakerName": "Iwakura Mitsunari",
            "text": "Yanagiha and Okazaki, as well as Mifune... why did they all leave me...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100303"
            ]
          },
          "721100303": {
            "id": "721100303",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "player",
            "text": "I've encountered the disciples of the Iwakura Art.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100304"
            ]
          },
          "721100304": {
            "id": "721100304",
            "speakerId": 20297,
            "speakerName": "Iwakura Mitsunari",
            "text": "Is that so...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100305"
            ]
          },
          "721100305": {
            "id": "721100305",
            "speakerId": 20297,
            "speakerName": "Iwakura Mitsunari",
            "text": "Are there still people who claim to be from Iwakura? Their Master was such an incompetent soul, after all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100306"
            ]
          },
          "721100306": {
            "id": "721100306",
            "speakerId": 20297,
            "speakerName": "Iwakura Mitsunari",
            "text": "I am Iwakura Mitsunari. You could consider me a sword instructor here. And who might you be?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100307"
            ]
          },
          "721100307": {
            "id": "721100307",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "player",
            "text": "#I'm {NICKNAME}.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100308"
            ]
          },
          "721100308": {
            "id": "721100308",
            "speakerId": 20297,
            "speakerName": "Iwakura Mitsunari",
            "text": "Mifune, Tanba... did you see them? The Okazaki brothers, too?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100309"
            ]
          },
          "721100309": {
            "id": "721100309",
            "speakerId": 20297,
            "speakerName": "Iwakura Mitsunari",
            "text": "Ah, yes, there's also Katayama. He always loved coming up with names for duels before they started.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100310"
            ]
          },
          "721100310": {
            "id": "721100310",
            "speakerId": 20297,
            "speakerName": "Iwakura Mitsunari",
            "text": "He'd say, \"If I become a real master swordsman in the future, then all these duels can written into stories.\" Hahaha, such nonsense...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100311"
            ]
          },
          "721100311": {
            "id": "721100311",
            "speakerId": 20297,
            "speakerName": "Iwakura Mitsunari",
            "text": "Right, and we mustn't forget Shimada, who spent the entire \"Eiin\" and \"Kouin\" eras training, yet could never advance beyond the rank of Shoden.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100312"
            ]
          },
          "721100312": {
            "id": "721100312",
            "speakerId": 20297,
            "speakerName": "Iwakura Mitsunari",
            "text": "They fled and became bandits because they could not fathom the power of the Almighty Shogun's Vision Hunt Decree.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100313"
            ]
          },
          "721100313": {
            "id": "721100313",
            "speakerId": 20297,
            "speakerName": "Iwakura Mitsunari",
            "text": "I miss the good old days of teaching them how to wield a sword. Why in the world did I shut the dojo down and join the army?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100314"
            ]
          },
          "721100314": {
            "id": "721100314",
            "speakerId": 20297,
            "speakerName": "Iwakura Mitsunari",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}, how're their abilities?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100317"
            ]
          },
          "721100317": {
            "id": "721100317",
            "speakerId": 20297,
            "speakerName": "Iwakura Mitsunari",
            "text": "Really...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100318"
            ]
          },
          "721100318": {
            "id": "721100318",
            "speakerId": 20297,
            "speakerName": "Iwakura Mitsunari",
            "text": "#Then, {NICKNAME}, who is your master? Is it Domon? Or Shousen? Or perhaps Narukami herself?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100319"
            ]
          },
          "721100319": {
            "id": "721100319",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "player",
            "text": "I think I might be considered \"self-taught.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100320"
            ]
          },
          "721100320": {
            "id": "721100320",
            "speakerId": 20297,
            "speakerName": "Iwakura Mitsunari",
            "text": "I see.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100321"
            ]
          },
          "721100321": {
            "id": "721100321",
            "speakerId": 20297,
            "speakerName": "Iwakura Mitsunari",
            "text": "It seems like the Iwakura Art has waned under my watch. None of my students were able to defeat a self-learned swordsman.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100322"
            ]
          },
          "721100322": {
            "id": "721100322",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "player",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100323"
            ]
          },
          "721100323": {
            "id": "721100323",
            "speakerId": 20297,
            "speakerName": "Iwakura Mitsunari",
            "text": "Is that so? I understand.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100324"
            ]
          },
          "721100324": {
            "id": "721100324",
            "speakerId": 20297,
            "speakerName": "Iwakura Mitsunari",
            "text": "Whatever your school of swordsmanship is, it doesn't matter.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100325"
            ]
          },
          "721100325": {
            "id": "721100325",
            "speakerId": 20297,
            "speakerName": "Iwakura Mitsunari",
            "text": "It seems like the Iwakura Art has waned under my watch. None of my students were able to defeat someone who is unwilling to reveal the name of their school.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100326"
            ]
          },
          "721100326": {
            "id": "721100326",
            "speakerId": 20297,
            "speakerName": "Iwakura Mitsunari",
            "text": "I truly am an incompetent Master of the Iwakura Art. As a swordsman, they call me Iwakura Kouin.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100327"
            ]
          },
          "721100327": {
            "id": "721100327",
            "speakerId": 20297,
            "speakerName": "Iwakura Mitsunari",
            "text": "Although I have forgotten the key to our secret blade technique and my Vision was surrendered to the Almighty Shogun...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100328"
            ]
          },
          "721100328": {
            "id": "721100328",
            "speakerId": 20297,
            "speakerName": "Iwakura Mitsunari",
            "text": "...If you asked me if I still wish to avenge those disciples of mine who could not bear to see my degradation and wound up pursuing the path of wicked ghosts...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100329"
            ]
          },
          "721100329": {
            "id": "721100329",
            "speakerId": 20297,
            "speakerName": "Iwakura Mitsunari",
            "text": "...Yet who were incompetent and lost to you, then I do still have some of that fire within me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721100330"
            ]
          },
          "721100330": {
            "id": "721100330",
            "speakerId": 20297,
            "speakerName": "Iwakura Mitsunari",
            "text": "This space is too small. It would be no place for even you to show off your swordsmanship. Come, follow me down."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}